NOTICE — third-party binaries in bin/

The recorders in bin/darwin-arm64, bin/darwin-x64 and bin/linux-x64 were
built from recorder/recorder.c of opencode-dictate
(https://github.com/rodri45l/opencode-dictate), which is MIT-licensed:

  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Rodrigo

The recorder is a thin wrapper around miniaudio (MIT-0 / public-domain
style licence, https://github.com/mackron/miniaudio) talking directly to
CoreAudio (macOS) / ALSA / PulseAudio (Linux). It streams raw 16 kHz mono
PCM to stdout and stops itself at a deadline; it performs no network I/O.
